{"id":"n60558-2-7","stage":5,"title":"빈틈 · 漏洞","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60558-2-7-1","ko":"쟤는 얼굴도 잘생겼는데 착하고 공부도 잘해.","zh":"他不仅长得帅，还善良，学习也非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쟤는","meaning":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"쟤：“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"쟤","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71213","senseId":"1","lemma":"쟤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쟤는","audio":"/audio/75fff6510e5032dd7e75.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴도","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴도","audio":"/audio/87178fcadbbffb4739aa.mp3"}},{"text":"잘생겼는데","meaning":"好看，漂亮，英俊","explanation":"잘생기다：好看，漂亮，英俊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"잘생기다","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24881","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘생겼는데","audio":"/audio/e7d159a875a5a80b1f1b.mp3"}},{"text":"착하고","meaning":"善良","explanation":"착하다：善良；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"착하다","audio":"/audio/44db3fd508e6c9f93bd0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71732","senseId":"1","lemma":"착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"착하고","audio":"/audio/00ebd1cca0f64e076ec1.mp3"}},{"text":"공부도","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부도","audio":"/audio/f7c65ea80bfdbd2ebfd7.mp3"}},{"text":"잘해.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘해","audio":"/audio/e758d705a95b3659b348.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"07345a466b2427d0","term":"쟤","zh":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3","entryId":"71213","definition":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"c56f4bd1fb4139c5","term":"잘생기다","zh":"好看，漂亮，英俊","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3","entryId":"24881","definition":"人的容貌出众。","pronunciation":["잘생기다"]},{"id":"44db3fd508e6c9f9","term":"착하다","zh":"善良","audio":"/audio/44db3fd508e6c9f93bd0.mp3","entryId":"71732","definition":"心灵或行动等美好正直，十分温和。","pronunciation":["차카다"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4eebed4003aab1e625fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60558-2-7-2","ko":"그래도 잘 찾아보면 어딘가 빈틈이 있을 거야.","zh":"不过只要仔细找，应该还是能找到他的缺点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아보면","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아보면","audio":"/audio/f4e9d90cb0874adda92a.mp3"}},{"text":"어딘가","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어딘가","audio":"/audio/656257d1c22e638428b2.mp3"}},{"text":"빈틈이","meaning":"漏洞，疏漏","explanation":"빈틈：漏洞，疏漏；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빈틈","audio":"/audio/6e408f657d4c25c4253c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60558","senseId":"2","lemma":"빈틈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빈틈이","audio":"/audio/17a68f7ce132b55be683.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"6e408f657d4c25c4","term":"빈틈","zh":"漏洞，疏漏","audio":"/audio/6e408f657d4c25c4253c.mp3","entryId":"60558","definition":"不足或疏忽之处。","pronunciation":["빈ː틈"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/01dab40d10d49d5d3d91.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.175,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60558","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":3.0017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不过只要仔细找，应该还是能找到他的缺点吧。","他不仅长得帅，还善良，学习也非常好。","那座雕像塑造的是谁？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他不仅长得帅，还善良，学习也非常好。","那座雕像塑造的是谁？","不过只要仔细找，应该还是能找到他的缺点吧。"],"answer":2}]}
